{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00594",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 10.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I was told to come for my follow-up after losing the baby, three weeks on from the hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.17,
      "end_seconds": 21.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Good afternoon, do sit down. I'm very sorry for what you've been through. How have you been coping, in yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.2,
      "end_seconds": 32.69,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "Oh, one gets on with it, thank you. My husband has been marvellous, he's even taken up cooking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.21,
      "end_seconds": 39.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Has he? What's his signature dish?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.35,
      "end_seconds": 49.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Cheese on toast, I'm afraid. Burnt, mostly. But it's the thought that counts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.91,
      "end_seconds": 60.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "Quite right. Now, tell me about the body side of things. Anything bothering you at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.4,
      "end_seconds": 69.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "There's some cramping low down, like period pains, mainly in the evenings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.82,
      "end_seconds": 80.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "When did the cramping begin? Was it straight after you came home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.96,
      "end_seconds": 90.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "Goodness, I really couldn't say. It might have been the week after, or perhaps before, it's all rather a blur."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.07,
      "end_seconds": 96.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "That's completely understandable. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.81,
      "end_seconds": 108.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "I've been terribly tired, for about three weeks. I'm in bed by eight, which is not like me at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.15,
      "end_seconds": 118.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Mm. Have you had any fever or shivers since you came home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.69,
      "end_seconds": 129.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "No, no fever at all. I did check, because the nurse at the ward told me to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.09,
      "end_seconds": 139.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "Good, that's what I wanted to hear. Do you have any history of operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.39,
      "end_seconds": 147.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Only my appendix, taken out when I was fifteen. Nothing since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.77,
      "end_seconds": 155.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "And anyone in the family with gynaecological trouble? Mother, sisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.15,
      "end_seconds": 163.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "My mother had fibroids, if that's relevant. She never really spoke about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.33,
      "end_seconds": 175.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "It's worth knowing, thank you. Now, forgive me, I must ask about allergies. Any to medicines or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.7,
      "end_seconds": 191.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.51,
      "text": "Well, that's the odd thing. I think I might be allergic to something they gave me in hospital, but nobody could tell me what."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.63,
      "end_seconds": 198.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Do you remember what happened when you took it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.58,
      "end_seconds": 210.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "I felt dreadful for an hour or so, and the nurse made a note. Then everyone went rather vague about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.63,
      "end_seconds": 225.86,
      "duration_seconds": 14.23,
      "text": "I see. So we have a possible allergy, no name, no clear reaction. I'll ask the hospital to send their notes, but let's be careful in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.99,
      "end_seconds": 234.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Yes please. I'd hate to make a fuss, but I'd rather know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.75,
      "end_seconds": 248.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.5,
      "text": "Not a fuss at all. Right, would you like a chaperone for the examination? Our healthcare assistant is just outside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.15,
      "end_seconds": 253.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Yes, that would be kind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 255.99,
      "end_seconds": 262.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Hello there, I'm Priya. I'll just stand by the curtain, shout if you need anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.6,
      "end_seconds": 268.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Thank you, Priya. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.35,
      "end_seconds": 294.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "Lie back for me and let your knees relax. I'm pressing gently on your tummy now. Tell me if it's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.22,
      "end_seconds": 302.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "That's fine, doctor. Just a bit strange having it pressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.34,
      "end_seconds": 321.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "The abdomen feels soft, and there's no tenderness in the lower right side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.55,
      "end_seconds": 330.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "All finished. You can sit up whenever you're ready. Priya, thanks, that's all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 331.55,
      "end_seconds": 338.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "No problem, doctor. I'll leave you to it. Take care, love."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.94,
      "end_seconds": 343.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Goodbye, and thank you again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.58,
      "end_seconds": 357.37,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "Now, what I'm seeing and hearing is most likely a womb that's settling back down normally. The cramps fit with that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.69,
      "end_seconds": 365.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "That is a relief. I had imagined all sorts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.65,
      "end_seconds": 385.36,
      "duration_seconds": 17.71,
      "text": "The tiredness is common too, but I'd like to give you iron tablets. Ferrous sulfate 200 mg twice a day, with a little orange juice if you can bear it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.38,
      "end_seconds": 393.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Orange juice I can manage. The cheese on toast may be harder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.54,
      "end_seconds": 404.82,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "Ha. Tea can block the iron, so keep your cuppa away from the tablets by an hour or so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.74,
      "end_seconds": 419.09,
      "duration_seconds": 11.35,
      "text": "Gosh, that's going to be the hard part. Is it all right to carry on walking in the garden?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.46,
      "end_seconds": 429.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "Gentle walks are good for you. Go at your own pace and rest when you need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.43,
      "end_seconds": 438.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Wonderful. My roses need me, you see. I've been neglecting them dreadfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.95,
      "end_seconds": 444.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "What sort do you grow?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.41,
      "end_seconds": 453.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Mostly old English roses. Tea scented, and a few climbers that have gone rather wild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 455.47,
      "end_seconds": 467.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.99,
      "text": "Lovely. Do keep some energy for the rest of life as well. And if you ever feel you want to talk to someone, tell us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 470.25,
      "end_seconds": 477.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "That's very good to know, thank you. I may well do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 479.29,
      "end_seconds": 483.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Any other questions before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 484.37,
      "end_seconds": 491.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "No, I think you've covered everything. You've been very kind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 492.22,
      "end_seconds": 500.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Look after yourself. The prescription will be at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 502.01,
      "end_seconds": 503.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Marvellous. Goodbye, then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 506.81,
      "end_seconds": 510.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Goodbye, and mind the step by the door."
    }
  ]
}
